00:04:05.307 --> 00:04:11.451
<v Host>The post included a photo of the proposal — Kihara kneeling on the ice and giving Miura a ring.

00:04:12.051 --> 00:04:14.259
<v Vocab>指輪

00:04:14.659 --> 00:04:17.660
<v Host>It means a ring, the kind you wear on your finger.

00:04:18.259 --> 00:04:32.971
