00:05:01.971 --> 00:05:10.228
<v Host>Miura is twenty-four and Kihara is thirty-four, and fans know the pair by an affectionate nickname made from their given names.

00:05:10.827 --> 00:05:13.156
<v Vocab>愛称

00:05:13.555 --> 00:05:15.908
<v Host>It means an affectionate nickname.

00:05:16.507 --> 00:05:30.139
<v Slow>その後、めきめきと力をつけて、2023年の世界選手権では、日本のペアとして初めて優勝しました。

00:05:30.939 --> 00:05:39.124
<v Host>After that they improved rapidly, and in twenty twenty-three they became the first Japanese pair to win the World Championships.

00:05:39.723 --> 00:05:42.867
