00:05:43.267 --> 00:05:48.620
<v Host>It means the World Championships — the top international competition in a sport.

00:05:49.220 --> 00:05:59.660
<v Slow>今年4月に競技生活を引退し、現在はプロのスケーターとして活動しています。

00:06:00.459 --> 00:06:05.860
<v Host>They retired from competition this April and now perform as professional skaters.

00:06:06.459 --> 00:06:08.716
